bounce.comboSizeStep,0.06,0,0.3,"bounce size added per ricochet, as a fraction of the pellet's launch size — the DRAWN shot and its HITBOX together, so a swollen ricochet genuinely finds its next body more easily. The spring that pops it there is CONFIG.bounce.comboSpring, which is feel and stays on sliders"
bounce.comboSizeMax,1.5,1,4,"bounce size ceiling, as a multiple of launch size. The spring overshoots this on the way in (that is the pop) and settles back onto it"
